<title>USA: JP says antitrust period expires for Rykoff.</title>
<headline>JP says antitrust period expires for Rykoff.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Foodservice Inc said Monday that the Hart-Scott-Rodino waiting period for its proposed merger with Rykoff-Sexton Inc expired on August 2.</p>
<p>The company said no further federal antitrust review is required for the merger.</p>
<p>JP Foodservice, a distributor of food and related products to restaurants and institutions, is planning to acquire Rykoff in a deal valued at $1.4 billion in cash and debt.</p>
</text>
